        "model": "GPT-6"
      },
      "text": "A 20-day group tour from 23 October to 11 November 2026. Visit Rio, both sides of Iguazú Falls, Buenos Aires and Montevideo, then continue to Chile, the Bolivian highlands and Peru's Inca sites. Accommodation in 4-star hotels, domestic flights and the excursions listed in the itinerary are included."
    },
