        "model": "GPT-6"
      },
      "text": "Per person: USD 9,450 based on two people sharing a double room (½ DBL), or USD 11,150 in a single room (SGL). 4-star hotels, domestic flights and the ferry to Montevideo are included. We confirm the final price at booking."
